  m_Name: MovementPage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BoundSpiritRuntime::JournalPage
  leftPageText: 'MOVEMENT:

    To move, you may use the arrow keys or WASD for the
    respective direction you wish to float.'
  rightPageText: 'INTERACTION:

    There will be many objects you can interact with.
    Interactable objects will have a prompt, letting you know you can interact with
    them. Interact by pressing ''E''. Sometimes, this will cause a popup to appear.
    To exit an interaction popup, press ''E'' again.'
